"baştir a Unicode, <a href=\"http://php.net/mbstring\">extension-ê "
"PHP mbstring</a> saz bike."

msgid "The %entity_type entity type needs to be installed."
msgstr ""
"باید جۆری %entity_type دانستنی (entity type) لەسەر "
"دامەزرێت."

msgid "The %entity_type entity type needs to be updated."
msgstr ""
"بەستەری %entity_type پێویستە بە "
"نوێکرنێتەوە."

